              "inline_data": null,
              "text": "To access and manage your Wells Fargo credit card online, you can sign in directly through the official website or using their mobile app. \n\n### 1. Official Login Page\n* **Website:** Go directly to the official [Wells Fargo Homepage](https://www.wellsfargo.com). \n* **How to Log In:** On the homepage, you will see the **Sign On** widget. Enter your **Username** and **Password**, then click **Sign On**. Your credit card accounts will be listed on your main account summary page once you log in.\n\n### 2. First-Time Users (Enrollment)\nIf you have a new credit card and have not set up online access yet, you will need to enroll:\n* Visit the [Wells Fargo Enrollment Page](https://enroll.wellsfargo.com) to register.\n* You will need your Social Security Number (SSN) or Individual Taxpayer Identification Number (ITIN), along with your credit card account number.\n\n### 3. Forgot Your Username or Password?\nIf you are having trouble logging in:\n* Click the **\"Forgot username or password?\"** link directly under the login fields on the main homepage.\n* You will be prompted to verify your identity to recover your username or reset your password.\n\n### 4. Manage via Mobile App\nYou can also download the official **Wells Fargo Mobile\u00ae app** from the Apple App Store or Google Play Store. The app allows you to log in using biometrics (like Face ID or fingerprint), view your balance, and make credit card payments directly from your phone.\n\n---\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f **Security Reminder:** Always ensure the URL in your browser's address bar starts with **`https://www.wellsfargo.com`** before entering your personal information or login credentials to protect yourself from phishing scams.",
